      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS  are delighted to present 10 Castlegrange Avenue to the Dublin 15 market. This is a stunning two-bedroom mid-terraced home with great attic conversion acting as a 3rd bedroom. Castlegrange is a well-established and family-friendly development in the heart of Castaheany, Dublin 15. The location is second to none, with a wide range of amenities nearby including schools, shops, and recreational facilities. The area is well serviced by public transport, with regular bus routes and easy access to Coolmine Train Station, while the N3 and M50 road networks are just minutes away, providing seamless connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and spacious accommodation of approximately 92 sq m comprises of a an entrance hallway leading into the cosy front lounge room which then brings you into the kitchen/dinning room. The ground floor also benefits of a guest W.C and a utility room. Heading upstairs to the landing there is the main family bathroom and the two spacious bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes and the master benefitting with an ensuite. From the landing you can reach the attic conversion which is well designed for a third bedroom, playroom or home office. Externally to the rear the doors from the kitchen lead you to the rear garden with decking and a pergola for that unpredictable Irish weather. The front benefits from communal parking.\n\nNo. 10 is not one to be missed as it is ready for immediate occupancy with no onward chain. This stunning 2/3 bed is a great starting position for first time buyers wanting to get on the property ladder. Additional features include a B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage, attic conversion for great potentional use, smart understairs storage, utility room, 3 bathrooms, good layout throughout with an ideal family orientated location.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n-2 bed with Attic Conversion\n-Mid Terrace home\n-3 Bathrooms\n-B BER rating qualifying of a green mortgage\n-Smart under-stairs storage\n-Utilty room\n-Rear garden with pergola\n-Stunning layout throughout\n-Ready for Immediate occupancy!\n-Parking to the front\n-Gas fired central heating\n-Ideal family location\n-Serviced by public transport with regular bus routes\n-Easy access to Coolmine Train Station\n-ENQUIRE NOW to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D15 Y99K"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 9"
      }
